          "fields": {
            "display_title": "The manuscript mainly presents a cheap pruning algorithm for dense layers of DNNs. It reformulates the non-convex optimization problem in (Aghasi et al., 2016) as a difference of convex (DC) problem, which can be solved quite efficiently using the DCA algorithm (Tao and An, 1997). The contribution is valuable since the complexity is significantly reduced, but there are many syntax errors and the accuracy of the model is not satisfactory.",
